21
00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:53.770
It is Season 8, Episode 23.

22
00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:56.690
We are really getting to the end of the line here.

23
00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:57.930
I know, lady.

24
00:00:58.130 --> 00:00:58.690
I know.

25
00:00:59.110 --> 00:00:59.490
Yeah.

26
00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:04.890
I'm on the last disc, you know, of Season 8, DVD, last disc.

27
00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:08.630
You're going to be opening up a whole new DVD set soon.

28
00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:09.630
I know.

29
00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:11.450
The last one.

30
00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:13.250
Oh, my gosh.

31
00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:14.110
I'm not ready.

32
