You know my feelings about a mug.

241
00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:06.930
I do.

242
00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:07.470
I do.

243
00:11:07.650 --> 00:11:08.410
Oh, my gosh.

244
00:11:08.510 --> 00:11:10.030
We are everyone's old aunt.

245
00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:10.430
All right.

246
00:11:10.490 --> 00:11:11.250
We'll be right back.

247
00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:25.430
Well, we are back, and I can't wait any longer.

248
00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:26.490
Angela, please.

249
00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:31.450
Oh, it's right away at 0.01 seconds.

