1486
01:14:22.350 --> 01:14:23.330
The Doors?

1487
01:14:23.330 --> 01:14:24.290
What are you doing?

1488
01:14:24.610 --> 01:14:28.750
But at the end, Jim Morrison just sort of starts talking.

1489
01:14:29.130 --> 01:14:29.890
Here it is.

1490
01:14:36.070 --> 01:14:37.670
I am the Lizard King.

1491
01:14:40.640 --> 01:14:44.320
Retire now to your tents and to your dreaMs.

1492
01:14:48.800 --> 01:14:51.140
Tomorrow we enter the town of my birth.

1493
01:14:54.890 --> 01:14:56.250
I want to be ready.

1494
01:14:59.870 --> 01:15:02.930
Oh, I mean, kind of tracks with Robert.

1495
01:15:03.310 --> 01:15:06.050
Sounds like Robert maybe has listened to this, in my opinion.

1496
01:15:06.310 --> 01:15:13.630
Is it true that Jim Morrison claimed that he could talk to lizards and control them with his mind,

1497
01:15:13.630 --> 01:15:16.230
and that's why he called himself the Lizard King?

1498
01:15:16.550 --> 01:15:22.210
Is this maybe Robert California's belief that he can control others with his mind?

1499
01:15:22.210 --> 01:15:24.190
Is that what we're getting at here?

1500
01:15:25.210 --> 01:15:25.730
Maybe.

1501
01:15:25.970 --> 01:15:27.690
I don't know any of that.

1502
01:15:27.930 --> 01:15:32.850
I will say I think Robert California is probably someone who has researched the reptilian brain,

1503
01:15:33.170 --> 01:15:35.970
what that brings out in men, etc.

1504
01:15:35.970 --> 01:15:43.010
I'm also pretty sure that Robert California is someone who has listened to an entire 17-minute Doors song.

1505
01:15:43.410 --> 01:15:45.310
17 minutes and 10 seconds.

1506
01:15:45.310 --> 01:15:51.070
I think that if you want to persuade someone to stay off drugs,

1507
01:15:51.350 --> 01:15:54.590
you could maybe play the end of this song for them,

1508
01:15:54.750 --> 01:15:59.330
