1509
01:16:00.530 --> 01:16:02.590
Don't do drugs, everyone.

1510
01:16:03.310 --> 01:16:04.230
Don't vape.

1511
01:16:04.750 --> 01:16:05.570
Stop the vaping.

1512
01:16:05.710 --> 01:16:06.710
