1514
01:16:09.210 --> 01:16:10.010
It's worse.

1515
01:16:10.330 --> 01:16:12.850
It creates crystals on your lungs.

1516
01:16:13.010 --> 01:16:14.610
It really destroys your lungs.

1517
01:16:14.730 --> 01:16:18.650
It was like, you know, the idea was that it was better, but it's not better.

1518
01:16:18.670 --> 01:16:19.570
It's awful.

1519
01:16:19.570 --> 01:16:22.290
It can lead to strokes at a very young age.

1520
01:16:22.770 --> 01:16:24.570
People are terribly sick from it.

1521
01:16:24.770 --> 01:16:25.210
Stop it.

1522
01:16:25.530 --> 01:16:26.290
Stop with the vaping.

1523
01:16:26.430 --> 01:16:29.450
Also, it's like it comes in like flavors and stuff.

1524
01:16:29.590 --> 01:16:30.690
It just don't do it.

1525
01:16:30.930 --> 01:16:32.350
Stop doing it, everyone.

1526
01:16:33.010 --> 01:16:33.990
You know what I mean?

1527
01:16:34.310 --> 01:16:36.190
I'm going to put this in my diet book.

1528
01:16:36.190 --> 01:16:39.190
Oh, your diet book that I've titled Don't Be an Idiot?

1529
01:16:39.390 --> 01:16:39.770
Yeah.

1530
01:16:40.150 --> 01:16:42.830
And it's going to have a section on don't vape either.

1531
01:16:43.330 --> 01:16:45.270
You are ready for your 50s.

1532
01:16:45.350 --> 01:16:46.610
I really am.

1533
01:16:46.750 --> 01:16:47.470
You really are.

1534
01:16:47.950 --> 01:16:49.170
No nonsense.

1535
01:16:49.170 --> 01:16:50.890
I don't have time for the nonsense.

1536
01:16:52.090 --> 01:16:53.010
No time.

1537
