1543
01:17:14.350 --> 01:17:20.630
Olivia, I don't know what version you were watching, but mine is fully blurred and fully bleeped.

1544
01:17:21.210 --> 01:17:22.230
Steve Burgess said,

1545
01:17:22.230 --> 01:17:25.670
The only note from standards and practices was this.

1546
01:17:26.050 --> 01:17:33.570
As previously noted, please blur Robert's lip flap when he says, quote, f***ing to Andy on the phone.

1547
01:17:33.850 --> 01:17:39.610
So no reference in the script or from standards and practices for mother effing.

1548
01:17:40.130 --> 01:17:43.650
And my lip flap was blurred and bleeped.

1549
01:17:43.990 --> 01:17:47.190
Olivia, what version of this episode do you have?

1550
01:17:47.810 --> 01:17:53.470
Well, I will also share that in the shooting draft, it is just, I'm the f***ing Lizard King.

1551
01:17:53.630 --> 01:17:54.470
So there's no mother.

1552
01:17:54.770 --> 01:17:55.470
No mother.

1553
01:17:55.750 --> 01:17:56.410
No mother.

1554
01:17:57.050 --> 01:17:57.530
Mm-mm.

1555
01:17:57.930 --> 01:17:59.650
We're going to have a big twist now.

1556
01:18:00.210 --> 01:18:01.330
Andy gets out of his car.

1557
01:18:01.510 --> 01:18:05.330
He walks up to a very famous green door, knocks on it.

1558
01:18:05.510 --> 01:18:06.550
