Jessica, the first house we used for David Wallace's house was in Pasadena.

1581
01:19:20.190 --> 01:19:21.970
This house was in Encino.

1582
01:19:22.130 --> 01:19:23.550
They are two different houses.

1583
01:19:23.550 --> 01:19:28.710
And, like you said, the original Pasadena house went on the market in 2021.

1584
01:19:28.850 --> 01:19:31.370
It did spark a huge bidding war.

1585
01:19:31.570 --> 01:19:36.630
The house eventually sold for over its $6 million asking price.

1586
01:19:36.910 --> 01:19:37.590
Cha-ching.

1587
01:19:38.510 --> 01:19:42.610
I found a blogger by the name of Rob on Location.

1588
01:19:42.770 --> 01:19:45.810
He has an extensive breakdown of all of our locations.

1589
01:19:45.810 --> 01:19:50.670
And he has visited both of David Wallace's homes.

1590
01:19:51.030 --> 01:19:52.050
And guess what?

1591
01:19:52.530 --> 01:19:56.270
When he visited the original Pasadena house in June of 2023,

1592
01:19:56.270 --> 01:19:59.430
it had been completely gutted.

1593
01:19:59.890 --> 01:20:00.890
Completely lady.

1594
01:20:01.170 --> 01:20:03.050
Like the whole facade.

1595
01:20:03.350 --> 01:20:04.350
Save the framing?

1596
01:20:04.690 --> 01:20:05.310
Yes.

1597
01:20:05.550 --> 01:20:11.710
Also, that means that they paid over $6 million for it and then basically tore it down.

1598
01:20:11.710 --> 01:20:12.750
I don't get it.

1599
01:20:12.910 --> 01:20:13.850
I don't get it.

1600
01:20:14.090 --> 01:20:14.810
Bonkers.

1601
01:20:15.450 --> 01:20:20.710
And then he had visited the Encino house in 2022, and it was also under renovation.

1602
01:20:20.710 --> 01:20:21.750
He has photos.

1603
01:20:22.210 --> 01:20:25.170
Angela, I'll give you the website for Office Lady Stories.

1604
01:20:25.730 --> 01:20:26.250
Okay.

1605
01:20:26.970 --> 01:20:27.870
Rob on Location.

1606
01:20:28.090 --> 01:20:31.090
