1653
01:23:37.190 --> 01:23:39.930
You know, like, what's it going to be today?

1654
01:23:40.630 --> 01:23:43.930
I mean, we even got a Pam, too, except her name's Sharon, and she's pretty funny looking.

1655
01:23:44.410 --> 01:23:47.930
She's in love with this guy, Matt, and he's really ugly, too.

1656
01:23:47.930 --> 01:23:52.570
They got kind of a will they, won't they thing going, only everyone's rooting for won't they.

1657
01:23:52.750 --> 01:23:57.650
I cannot stress enough how unappealing these two individuals are, truly.

1658
01:23:57.830 --> 01:23:59.710
If they ever got together, it would destroy your project.

1659
01:24:02.670 --> 01:24:10.400
Seeing these people as he's describing a whole montage.

1660
01:24:10.400 --> 01:24:10.620
Oh, my gosh.

1661
01:24:11.100 --> 01:24:11.600
Oh, my goodness.

1662
01:24:11.600 --> 01:24:12.620
And you see everybody.

1663
01:24:14.820 --> 01:24:15.260
Wow.

1664
01:24:15.600 --> 01:24:18.180
Well, that is a great way to end this episode.

1665
